---
// From design-reference/Rulebook.dc.html, updated so free kicks are taken from a halfway
// tick mark on a side wall, not the spot of the foul. Edit the SVG here, not in Sanity.
---
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 16px; max-width: 860px; margin: 4px 0 12px 80px" class="rule-figs">
<figure style="margin: 0; border: 2px solid #3CA8E4; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #0F0F19">
<svg role="img" aria-label="Indirect free kick" viewBox="0 0 400 240" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; background: #0E2A1C; border-radius: 14px">
<rect x="4" y="4" width="392" height="232" rx="18" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A44" stroke-width="6"></rect>
<line x1="200" y1="10" x2="200" y2="230" stroke="#4E7F66" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"></line>
<path d="M388 74 A46 46 0 0 0 388 166 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.14)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></path>
<path d="M12 74 A46 46 0 0 1 12 166 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.14)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></path>
<rect x="388" y="98" width="8" height="44" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect><rect x="4" y="98" width="8" height="44" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect><rect x="197" y="2" width="6" height="14" rx="2" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect><rect x="197" y="224" width="6" height="14" rx="2" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect>
<line x1="284" y1="212" x2="212" y2="214" stroke="#8F8EA3" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 5"></line><line x1="286" y1="206" x2="298" y2="218" stroke="#8F8EA3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="298" y1="206" x2="286" y2="218" stroke="#8F8EA3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></line><text x="292" y="196" fill="#8F8EA3" font-family="Archivo, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">Foul was here</text><path d="M166 222 A34 34 0 0 1 234 222" fill="none" stroke="#F4F3F8" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></path><text x="140" y="196" fill="#F4F3F8" font-family="Archivo, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">3 yards</text><text x="200" y="32" fill="#F4F3F8" font-family="Archivo, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">Halfway mark</text><circle cx="182" cy="214" r="10" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="200" cy="214" r="5.5" fill="#F5D90A" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><circle cx="268" cy="156" r="10" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><line x1="207" y1="208" x2="251.5" y2="169.7" stroke="#F5D90A" stroke-width="2.5"></line><path d="M259 163 L247.4 167.0 L254.6 175.3 Z" fill="#F5D90A"></path><line x1="278" y1="151" x2="373.6" y2="131.3" stroke="#F5D90A" stroke-width="2.5"></line><path d="M384 129 L372.1 126.0 L374.3 136.8 Z" fill="#F5D90A"></path><circle cx="250" cy="110" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="336" cy="104" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="352" cy="200" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle>
</svg>
<figcaption style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-self: flex-start; background: #3CA8E4; color: #0A0A12; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px">Legal</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; color: #F4F3F8">Indirect free kick</span>
<span style="color: #C9C8D8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Free kicks are not taken where the foul happened. The ball goes on the halfway mark on the left or right side wall. Free kicks are indirect: the ball must touch a second player before a goal counts. Defenders give 3 yards.</span>
<span style="color: #3CA8E4; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px">From the halfway mark. Pass first, then shoot.</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure style="margin: 0; border: 2px solid #FF6B6B; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #0F0F19">
<svg role="img" aria-label="Shooting straight from a free kick" viewBox="0 0 400 240" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; background: #0E2A1C; border-radius: 14px">
<rect x="4" y="4" width="392" height="232" rx="18" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A44" stroke-width="6"></rect>
<line x1="200" y1="10" x2="200" y2="230" stroke="#4E7F66" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"></line>
<path d="M388 74 A46 46 0 0 0 388 166 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.14)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></path>
<path d="M12 74 A46 46 0 0 1 12 166 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.14)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></path>
<rect x="388" y="98" width="8" height="44" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect><rect x="4" y="98" width="8" height="44" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect><rect x="197" y="2" width="6" height="14" rx="2" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect><rect x="197" y="224" width="6" height="14" rx="2" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect>
<path d="M166 222 A34 34 0 0 1 234 222" fill="none" stroke="#F4F3F8" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></path><circle cx="182" cy="214" r="10" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="200" cy="214" r="5.5" fill="#F5D90A" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><line x1="207" y1="210" x2="374.3" y2="125.0" stroke="#F5D90A" stroke-width="2.5"></line><path d="M384 120 L371.8 120.1 L376.8 129.9 Z" fill="#F5D90A"></path><line x1="345" y1="128" x2="359" y2="142" stroke="#FF6B6B" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="359" y1="128" x2="345" y2="142" stroke="#FF6B6B" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line><circle cx="300" cy="104" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="244" cy="128" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="336" cy="196" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle>
</svg>
<figcaption style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-self: flex-start; background: #FF6B6B; color: #0A0A12; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px">No goal</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; color: #F4F3F8">Shooting straight from a free kick</span>
<span style="color: #C9C8D8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">A free kick from the halfway mark that goes straight into the goal without touching anyone else does not count.</span>
<span style="color: #FF6B6B; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px">No goal. Goal kick for the defense.</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
